stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Active : start
    state Active {
        [*] --> Working
        Working --> Paused : pause
        Paused --> Working : resume
        Working --> [*]
    }
    Active --> Idle : stop
    Idle : waits for input
    note right of Idle : sleeps a lot
    state fork_state <<fork>>
    Active --> fork_state
    fork_state --> Done
